num secret = 7
num attempts = 3
out **Welcome to the Guessing Game!**

while attempts > 0 do
    out You have <attempts> guesses left.
    in guess = Pick a number (0-10):
    
    if guess = secret do out **YOU WIN!**
    if guess = secret do stop
    
    attempts -= 1
    if attempts = 0 do out **GAME OVER. The number was 7.**

out Thanks for playing with Firefly!